    "title": "Sarah Jessica Parker Wows in Black & White Gown with Giant Wings at NYC Ballet's Fall Fashion Gala 2025 with Matthew Broderick! - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Just Jared ,\n13 hours ago Sarah Jessica Parker is turning heads on the red carpet!\nThe 60-year-old Sex and the City actress and her husband Matthew Broderick held hands as they arrived at the New York City Ballet’s 2025 Fall Fashion Gala on Wednesday evening (October 8) held at the David H. Koch Theater at Lincoln Center in New York City.\nFor the event, SJP wowed in a black and white sculptural gown with giant, floor-length black wings while the 63-year-old Ferris Bueller’s Day Off actor coordinated in a black tux.\nSJP is a frequent attendee of the NYC Ballet’s Fall Fashion Gala . Last year, she donned a silver tulle dress for the big event.\nOver the summer, the Emmy-winning actress gave a surprising update on the third Hocus Pocus movie.\nFYI: SJP is wearing Iris van Herpen .\nClick through the gallery inside for 10+ pictures of Sarah Jessica Parker and Matthew Broderick arriving at the event…",
